ike I should be doing more on my own. Sometimes it’s hard to balance relying on others and feeling competent.", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 157}, {"session_id": "p000024-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "But I worry that relying too much might affect my performance and standing with the team.", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 142}, {"session_id": "p000024-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not sure how to handle it all.", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 102}, {"session_id": "p000024-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's hard not to feel like I'm letting everyone down. Last time I asked for help, I got a bit of a lecture instead.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 115}, {"session_id": "p000024-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "I just need to feel capable, you know?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38}, {"session_id": "p000024-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "The last time I asked for help, it didn't feel supportive.", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000024-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "I just wish I could feel more competent without needing help sometimes.", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000024-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 21, "quote": "It means a lot to have someone who understands.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 47}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261002T200439Z", "last_updated_at": "20261002T200809Z", "first_seen_session": "p000024-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000024-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
